                        text = "You do not heal life points over time; only mystery meat heals you. Mystery meat restores all of your life points once eaten. The Eat Food ability does not consider mystery meat to be food, so you must click to eat it. Deaths are safe (safe for hardcore ironmen as well). The Persistent Rage relic power cannot be used to replenish adrenaline for Regenerate during the quest.",
                        npcs = { "mystery meat", "Eat Food", "Persistent Rage", "adrenaline", "Regenerate" },
