                        chat = "2 Ask about Desert Treasure / 4 Tell me of The four diamonds of Azzanadra / 1 Yes / 1 Yes, I will go get those for you. / 4 Tell me of The four diamonds of Azzanadra / 1 Yes / 1 Yes, I will go get those for you.",
                        npcs = { "Eblis" },
                        subs = {
                            { text = "He will not speak to you if you're wearing any Zamorak or Saradomin equipment." },
