        recommended = { "Master archaeologist's outfit or Archaeology teleport for various helpful teleports (White Knights' Castle, Infernal Source Dig Site, Archaeology Campus, Black Knights' Fortress, Jolly Boar Inn)", "Or your Archaeology journal for a quick teleport to the Tree of Balance and the Archaeology Campus, if the Master archaeologist outfit is not owned", "Activated Fort Forinthry lodestone or Varrock lodestone", "Karamja gloves 3 or higher for a nearby teleport to the gleaming wisp colony", "Or nature altar teleport for a teleport to the nature altar", "Or elder divination outfit for quick teleports to wisp colonies", "Portable fairy ring, TokKul-Zo, or cape of legends for quick access to fairy rings", "Or a Grace of the elves when one of the Max Guild portals is attuned to the Zanaris fairy ring", "Memory strand (in currency pouch) or Sixth-Age circuit for a quick teleport to Memorial to Guthix", "Enriched pontifex shadow ring for a quick teleport to Senntisten", "Invitation box for a quick teleport to the Empyrean Citadel", "Ring of respawn for a quick teleport to the White Knights' Castle" },
